=Motown] to create [l=Universal Motown], causing the Universal Motown Records Group to reinstate itself as the Universal Motown Republic Group.\n\nIn 2011, with the dismantling of Universal Motown and its UMRG unit, Universal Motown was folded to the revived Motown, while Universal Republic has been rebranded back as Republic. Today, releases under the urban unit of Universal Records and/or Universal Motown are being reissued by either Republic or Motown under [l=UMe]. However, the entirety of Universal Records remains dormant.\n\n[b]Only use this label for releases with a [u]Universal Records[/u] logo. Releases that contain only the standard Universal (black-and-white globe) logo must not be listed here.[/b]","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:796","relations":{"parentLabel":{"id":272782,"name":"UMG Recordings, Inc."},"sublabels":[{"id":1242754,"name":"Abrupt Records (2)"},{"id":2883098,"name":"Cause For Alarm (2)"},{"id":25392,"name":"Freedream"},{"id":37764,"name":"New Door Records"},{"id":104807,"name":"No Carbon Records"},{"id":414030,"name":"Pure Pain Records LLC."},{"id":17467,"name":"Riversal Records"},{"id":187549,"name":"Spacy Tracy"},{"id":195113,"name":"SWISHA HOUSE"}]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/796-Universal-Records","type":"label","urls":["http://web.archive.org/web/20080312065932/http://www.universalrecords.com/","https://universalrecords.com/password"]}},"/api/discogs/release/113915":{"cached":true,"release":{"artists":[{"id":null,"name":"Harmon Eyes"}],"formats":[],"genres":["Electronic"],"id":"113915","images":[],"labels":[{"catno":"LOOP 011","id":179847,"name":"Loop Records (4)"}],"styles":["Trance"],"title":"Iodine Sky EP","tracklist":["Iodine Sky","Pattern Propulsion","Wet Surface","Desert Landscape"],"uri":"https://www.discogs.com/release/113915","videos":[],"year":1994}},"/api/discogs/release/1143576/credits":{"cached":true,"credits":[{"id":810896,"name":"Calle 13","role":"Main Artist","type":"artist"}